WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.043
Interesting times

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:03.461
for white people.

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:05.672
I've been observing you,

00:00:05.755 --> 00:00:07.257
I see what's going on.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.883
You're trying really hard

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:10.427
to be nice to minorities,

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:12.762
in a way I've never seen before.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:13.888
Putting in the time.

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:14.973
Putting in the effort,

00:00:15.056 --> 00:00:16.141
getting out there.

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:18.435
Watching<i> Crazy Rich Asians.</i>

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:22.230
White people went in droves!
Very cool.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.274
Any white people here
see<i> Crazy Rich Asians?</i>

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:25.817
Raise your hands, anybody, yeah?

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:27.485
Yeah?

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:29.195
You, ma'am in the front,
you saw it?

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:32.532
Yeah, it had like a 97%
on Rotten Tomatoes.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:34.242
You think it was that good, 97%?

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:36.536
Maybe a little less?

00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:37.954
What number would you give it?

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:39.497
Eighty-five.

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:41.583
Eighty-five, wow.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:44.586
Twelve percent less.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.339
Anything in particular
you didn't like,

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:50.925
that made you dock it 12 points,
ma'am?

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:56.681
Are you nervous right now?

00:00:58.349 --> 00:00:59.476
I'm just messing with you,

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:01.394
it doesn't matter what
you think about the movie.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:04.022
It's just fun to make white
people feel bad, and--

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:10.862
This is so adorable,
look how far we've come.

00:01:11.988 --> 00:01:13.698
In just two generations, right?

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:15.074
Like, your grandma
doesn't even call it

00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:16.242
that movie<i> Crazy Rich Asians.</i>

00:01:16.326 --> 00:01:18.745
She calls it that movie
that has too many Orientals,

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.623
and now you're sitting here,
like,

00:01:21.706 --> 00:01:23.958
"Uh, 85%, shit,
I take it back, 97%.

00:01:24.042 --> 00:01:25.627
What do I need to say
to not get in trouble?"

00:01:28.379 --> 00:01:29.923
It's coming from a good place,

00:01:30.006 --> 00:01:31.674
but some people are acting weird,
man.

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:34.761
I asked this one lady,
I was like,

00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:35.929
"You see<i> Crazy Rich Asians?"</i>

00:01:36.012 --> 00:01:37.430
She's like, "Yeah!"
I was like, "You like it?"

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:39.682
She's like, "I actually didn't
see it, I'm sorry."

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:42.602
I'm like,
"What are you lying for?

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.813
What did you think? I was gonna
give you some cookies?"

00:01:46.231 --> 00:01:47.816
My favorite thing,
though, one time,

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:49.108
I asked someone, I was like,

00:01:49.192 --> 00:01:50.276
"You like<i> Crazy Rich Asians?"</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:51.486
They're like,
"You know what Aziz,

00:01:51.569 --> 00:01:52.946
I'm gonna be honest with you.

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:54.322
First time I saw it,

00:01:54.405 --> 00:01:55.532
I didn't really enjoy it.

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:58.451
But then I watched again,
with one of my Asian friends,

00:01:59.327 --> 00:02:01.287
and I saw how much
it meant to her

00:02:01.371 --> 00:02:03.623
to see herself represented
on the screen,

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.875
and that made me really
like the film."

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:09.170
And I said, "Oh, um, that doesn't
mean you like the movie.

00:02:09.254 --> 00:02:10.129
That's just a weird,

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:11.965
condescending,
shitty thing to say."

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:17.303
Could you imagine if I watched
<i>Paul Blart: Mall Cop?</i>

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.391
And I was like,
"I didn't really like it,

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:22.308
but then I watched it again

00:02:22.392 --> 00:02:24.185
with one of my one of
my chubby white friends...

00:02:26.104 --> 00:02:28.022
really changed my perspective!"

